    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_sp01_01",
      "hash64": "94C17C7A84111304",
      "text": "소울풀 비트 라임이라고 하면\\n세계에서 꽤나 알려져 있다고.[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_sp01_02",
      "hash64": "94C17F7A8411181D",
      "text": "이런 나를 불러내다니, 너는 진짜\\n대단한 거물이라니까! HA! HA! HA![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_sp01_03",
      "hash64": "94C17E7A8411166A",
      "text": "뭐, 챔피언의 제안을\\n거절할 생각은 없었지만![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_sp01_04",
      "hash64": "94C1797A84110DEB",
      "text": "나의 혼이 담긴 랩을\\n블루베리의 베이비들에게 가르쳐 주겠어![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_sp01_select_01",
      "hash64": "901D6A3D4A970823",
      "text": "부탁드려요!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_sp01_select_02",
      "hash64": "901D6B3D4A9709D6",
      "text": "랩이 아니라 배틀이요!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_sp01_05",
      "hash64": "94C1787A84110C38",
      "text": "제법 흐름을 탈 줄 아는데!\\n배틀 레슨도 걱정하지 말라고![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_sp01_05b",
      "hash64": "D5CC122E68F7FCEE",
      "text": "그래, 랩일 리가 없지!\\n그럴 줄 알았다니까! HA! HA! HA![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_sp02_00",
      "hash64": "3E5BB372E8A75448",
      "text": "블루베리에서는\\n더블배틀이 유행이구나.[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_sp02_01",
      "hash64": "3E5BB472E8A755FB",
      "text": "내가 더블배틀을 선호하는 이유는\\n생각할 게 많고 Deep 해서야![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_sp02_02",
      "hash64": "3E5BB572E8A757AE",
      "text": "두 마리의 기술을 Mash Up 할 수 있으면\\n최고로 SWAG 넘치는 세션이 만들어지니까![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_sp02_select_01",
      "hash64": "50FA35A9A0FBE382",
      "text": "그렇군요",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_sp02_select_02",
      "hash64": "50FA34A9A0FBE1CF",
      "text": "멋져요!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_sp02_03",
      "hash64": "3E5BB672E8A75961",
      "text": "HA! HA! HA!\\n너, 제대로 이해한 거 맞아!?[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_sp02_03b",
      "hash64": "9D300841545C4019",
      "text": "HA! HA! HA!\\n너, 뭘 좀 아는구나![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_sp02_04",
      "hash64": "3E5BB772E8A75B14",
      "text": "더블이 싱글보다 유행하게 된다면\\n나도 활동하기 편해질 거야.[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_sp02_05",
      "hash64": "3E5BB872E8A75CC7",
      "text": "그러니 블루베리의 베이비들에게\\n더블배틀의 테크닉을 뼛속까지 새겨 주겠어![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_sp03_00",
      "hash64": "6726A9679DCCFF19",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]!\\n나랑 이야기하면서 좀 쉬지 그래![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_sp03_01",
      "hash64": "6726A8679DCCFD66",
      "text": "너에게는 감사하고 있어.\\n나를 블루베리에 초대해 줬잖아.[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_sp03_02",
      "hash64": "6726A7679DCCFBB3",
      "text": "아이들에게 둘러싸이는 걸 좋아해서 말이야.\\n소울풀해서 파워가 솟아나는 기분이거든.[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_sp03_03",
      "hash64": "6726A6679DCCFA00",
      "text": "내가 아이들을 좋아하는 게\\n의외라고 생각하니?[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_sp03_select_01",
      "hash64": "C6693166A7261C05",
      "text": "네!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_sp03_select_02",
      "hash64": "C6692E66A72616EC",
      "text": "아니요",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_sp03_04",
      "hash64": "6726AD679DCD05E5",
      "text": "HA! HA! HA! 자주 듣는 말이야!\\n인상이 강해 보여서 그런가 봐![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_sp03_04b",
      "hash64": "13BE2E1123606465",
      "text": "HA! HA! HA! 너에겐 내가\\n상냥한 할머니처럼 보이나 보지?[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_sp03_05",
      "hash64": "6726AC679DCD0432",
      "text": "예전에는 좋아하지 않았지만\\n손주가 생기고 나서는\\r\\n아이들만 보면 껌뻑 죽게 됐어.[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_sp03_06",
      "hash64": "6726AB679DCD027F",
      "text": "그래서 그런지, 손주랑 비슷한 또래의\\n너희가 노력하는 모습을 보고 있으면\\r\\n괜히 눈시울이 뜨거워지곤 한다니까.[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_trade_01_00",
      "hash64": "FB86C2822AE6FD0B",
      "text": "HA! HA! HA!\\n내게 이런 감상적인 블루스는 어울리지 않아.[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_trade_01_01",
      "hash64": "FB86C1822AE6FB58",
      "text": "템포를 끌어올리도록 할까!\\n둘이서 같이 세션을 하자![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_trade_01_02",
      "hash64": "FB86C4822AE70071",
      "text": "흠~ 포켓몬 교환은 어때?\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)] a.k.a. 챔피언?[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_trade_01_03",
      "hash64": "FB86C3822AE6FEBE",
      "text": "내 제안은 DJ MANGMANG-E야!\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)][VAR 0x1900(0001)] 어떻게 할래?[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
